This direcotry provides information on customizing picoc
for use with EZAPP

============================
GENERAL INFO
============================

Changes to picoc are tagged with 'EZAPP'.

Issues requiring follow up are tagged with 'xxx'.

To view changes made to picoc:
  git diff 89f7b53128c196223bbab6a516e03bf0ab85e124 .

============================
PLATFORM LIBRARY GEN TOOL (libgen)
============================

Used to translate platform routine prototypes to format that
can be incorporated in platform/library_unix.c.

Usage example, refer to: run_libgen and libgen_in.h.

